    "source": "architecture \"Search & Rescue · UAF\" {\n  description \"From mission capabilities to operational activities, service functions, and resource implementation.\"\n  config { profile naf4-uaf }\n\n  model {\n    Capability sar \"Search & Rescue\"\n    Capability maritime \"Maritime rescue\"\n    Capability search \"Search coordination\"\n    relation specialize maritime -> sar \"Specializes\" { type CapabilityGeneralization }\n    relation requires maritime -> search \"Depends on\" { type CapabilityDependency }\n\n    OperationalPerformer coordination \"Rescue coordination centre\"\n    OperationalPerformer crew \"Rescue team\"\n    OperationalActivity assess \"Assess distress report\"\n    OperationalActivity dispatch \"Coordinate rescue\"\n    relation assignAssess coordination -> assess \"Can perform\" { type IsCapableToPerform }\n    relation assignDispatch coordination -> dispatch \"Can perform\" { type IsCapableToPerform }\n    relation activityCapability dispatch -> maritime \"Supports capability\" { type MapsToCapability }\n\n    ServiceSpecification rescueService \"Rescue coordination service\"\n    ServiceFunction coordinate \"Coordinate rescue assets\"\n    relation serviceCapability rescueService -> maritime \"Exhibits\" { type Exhibits }\n    relation serviceFunction rescueService -> coordinate \"Can perform\" { type IsCapableToPerform }\n    relation consumes dispatch -> rescueService \"Consumes\" { type Consumes }\n\n    Software platform \"Rescue coordination platform\" {\n      technology \"Web · Mission network\"\n      isStandardConfiguration false\n    }\n    Function dispatchFunction \"Dispatch rescue asset\"\n    relation resourceFunction platform -> dispatchFunction \"Can perform\" { type IsCapableToPerform }\n    relation implementsActivity dispatchFunction -> dispatch \"Implements activity\" { type Implements }\n    relation implementsService dispatchFunction -> coordinate \"Implements service function\" { type Implements }\n    relation implementsActor platform -> coordination \"Implements logical node\" { type Implements }\n\n    InformationElement distress \"Distress report\"\n    Standard standard \"Architecture standard\"\n    Requirement notes \"Neutral adapter\"\n    relation report coordination -> crew \"Shares distress report\" {\n      type OperationalExchange\n      conveyed [distress]\n      trustlevel 0.9\n    }\n  }\n\n  view overview \"Mission to implementation\" {\n    viewpoint L2-L3\n    include maritime, rescueService, coordinate, dispatch, dispatchFunction, platform\n    place maritime at (0, 0)\n    place rescueService at (350, 0)\n    place coordinate at (700, 0)\n    place dispatch at (0, 320)\n    place dispatchFunction at (350, 320)\n    place platform at (700, 320)\n    route serviceCapability { from left to right curve rounded }\n    route activityCapability { from top to bottom curve straight }\n    route consumes { from right to bottom via (275, 380), (275, 220), (460, 220) curve rounded label (370, 220) }\n    route implementsActivity { from left to right curve straight }\n    route implementsService { from top to bottom via (460, 200), (810, 200) curve rounded label (650, 200) }\n  }\n  view capabilities \"C1 · Capability taxonomy\" {\n    viewpoint C1\n    include sar, maritime\n  }\n  view services \"C1–S1 · Service contribution\" {\n    viewpoint C1-S1\n    include maritime, rescueService\n    direction down\n  }\n  view serviceFunctions \"S4 · Service functions\" {\n    viewpoint S4\n    include rescueService, coordinate\n  }\n  view activities \"L4 · Logical activities\" {\n    viewpoint L4\n    include coordination, assess, dispatch\n    route assignAssess { curve rounded }\n    route assignDispatch { curve rounded }\n  }\n  view interactions \"L3 · Operational exchange\" {\n    viewpoint L3\n    include coordination, crew, distress\n  }\n  view resources \"P4 · Resource functions\" {\n    viewpoint P4\n    include platform, dispatchFunction\n  }\n  view colors \"Semantic background colors\" {\n    viewpoint L2-L3\n    include sar, rescueService, assess, platform, standard, notes\n    place sar at (0, 0)\n    place rescueService at (300, 0)\n    place assess at (600, 0)\n    place platform at (0, 220)\n    place standard at (300, 220)\n    place notes at (600, 220)\n  }\n  view traceability \"L4–P4 · Realization trace\" {\n    viewpoint L4-P4\n    include dispatch, coordinate, dispatchFunction\n    place dispatchFunction at (0, 140)\n    place dispatch at (430, 0)\n    place coordinate at (430, 280)\n    route implementsActivity { from right to left via (320, 188), (320, 48) curve rounded label (320, 100) }\n    route implementsService { from right to left via (290, 188), (290, 328) curve rounded label (290, 280) }\n  }\n}\n"
